00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:32.023
Nobody likes a backseat driver, okay.

00:04:32.023 --> 00:04:33.118
So, they're sitting there.

00:04:33.118 --> 00:04:36.261
They're putting mental
pressure on the brakes,

00:04:36.261 --> 00:04:37.712
