00:04:50.509 --> 00:04:52.977
"That's wrong. Oh my
gosh, taxes are too high.

00:04:52.977 --> 00:04:55.572
"Taxes are too," dude, it's negative.

00:04:55.572 --> 00:04:58.155
It is negative. It is negative!

00:04:59.146 --> 00:05:01.784
Look, there's so much
abundance in negativity,

00:05:01.784 --> 00:05:06.130
