why there's no value in it.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.955
You got to make a commitment to service.

00:05:07.955 --> 00:05:11.273
You got to make a commitment to
like, "Hey, I have a target."

00:05:11.273 --> 00:05:13.731
I know that when we don't achieve
targets here in my office,

00:05:13.731 --> 00:05:16.697
the first thing I ask, regardless,
