00:06:08.582 --> 00:06:11.600
Those are flows coming in for one company.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.964
At some point, I'm like,
"Okay, let's do a second deal."

00:06:14.964 --> 00:06:17.933
So, I'm going to then have a
company that runs parallel,

00:06:17.933 --> 00:06:19.620
