00:08:37.167 --> 00:08:39.166
Nobody can tell you
what you're capable of.

00:08:39.166 --> 00:08:40.906
You're the only one that knows.

00:08:40.906 --> 00:08:43.960
Okay, so work to your
potential, not your quota.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.296
Quotas are numbers. Who made 'em up?

00:08:46.296 --> 00:08:49.335
