some numbers, some mechanics.

00:09:09.805 --> 00:09:13.295
Hey, my potential, I know.
Nobody else knows it.

00:09:13.295 --> 00:09:15.236
I know what it is. You know yours.

00:09:15.236 --> 00:09:17.645
Work to your potential, not just a quota,

00:09:17.645 --> 00:09:22.455
